软件本体不编译本插件源码。\n\n运行 `npm test` 和 `npm run typecheck`。真实 Chromium 验证可在完成构建后运行 `node test/browser.mjs`，可通过 `PLAYWRIGHT_CHROMIUM_EXECUTABLE_PATH` 指定已安装的 Chromium。该测试加载最终插件包，验证真实 Worker、中文双栏、裁剪 / 旋转页、跨页选区、搜索与资源清理；不作为 Windows/macOS/Linux 原生窗口验收。\n\n## 致谢\n\n使用 [Mozilla PDF.js 6.4.299](https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js/releases/tag/v6.4.299)（Apache-2.0）。包内包含其授权文件；文字层样式从官方样式中保留最小必要规则并限定到阅读器作用域。合成双栏测试 PDF 不包含用户资料。\n\n## 许可证\n\nCopyright (c) 2026 CharlesHsu。此官方插件按 AGPL-3.0-only 分发，完整协议见包内 `assets/licenses/AGPL-3.0.txt`；[对应源代码](https://github.com/KraHsu/repeaty/tree/codex/learning-scope/plugins/pdf-reader)。第三方组件继续遵循各自许可证。\n","assets":{"cmaps/78-EUC-H.bcmap":{"type":"application/octet-stream","base64":""},"cmaps/78-EUC-V.bcmap":{"type":"application/octet-stream","base64":"A+BSQ29weXJpZ2h0IDE5OTAtMjAwOSBBZG9iZSBTeXN0ZW1zIEluY29ycG9yYXRlZC4KQWxsIHJpZ2h0cyByZXNlcnZlZC4KU2VlIC4vTElDRU5TReEINzgtRVVDLUhhBaGiAb1PDQG9UQkCvVMCBL1WBBG9W0EVoeG9bYU/AAEAAQABAAEAGQAfAAEAAQAGAIEyAAEAAQABAAEAGQAfAAEAAQAGAGEBpfUBvgI="},"cmaps/78-H.bcmap":{"type":"application/octet-stream","base64":""},"cmaps/78-RKSJ-H.bcmap":{"type":"application/octet-stream","base64":""},"cmaps/78-RKSJ-V.bcmap":{"type":"application/octet-stream","base64":"A+BSQ29weXJpZ2h0IDE5OTAtMjAwOSBBZG9iZSBTeXN0ZW1zIEluY29ycG9yYXRlZC4KQWxsIHJpZ2h0cyByZXNlcnZlZC4KU2VlIC4vTElDRU5TReEJNzgtUktTSi1IYQWBQQG9Tw0BvVEJAr1TAgS9VgQRvVtBFYGBvW2CHQABAAEAAQABABkAHwABAAEABgBTAAEAAQABAAEAGQAgAAEAAQAGAGEBg5UBvgI="},"cmaps/78-V.bcmap":{"type":"application/octet-stream","base64":"A+BSQ29weXJpZ2h0IDE5OTAtMjAwOSBBZG9iZSBTeXN0ZW1zIEluY29ycG9yYXRlZC4KQWxsIHJpZ2h0cyByZXNlcnZlZC4KU2VlIC4vTElDRU5TReEENzgtSGEFISIBvU8NAb1RCQK9UwIEvVYEEb1bQRUhYb1thT8AAQABAAEAAQAZAB8AAQABAAYAgTIAAQABAAEAAQAZAB8AAQABAAYAYQEldQG+Ag=="},"cmaps/78ms-RKSJ-H.bcmap":{"type":"application/octet-stream","base64":""},"cmaps/78ms-RKSJ-V.bcmap":{"type":"application/octet-stream","base64":""},"cmaps/83pv-RKSJ-H.bcmap":{"type":"application/octet-stream","base64":""},"cmaps/90ms-RKSJ-H.bcmap":{"type"